No history thumbnails (WHY2025 badge, sdapps/README.md).

For each page NetSurf draws a thumbnail for its local history view: it
renders the page at full width into a 32-bit buffer first, 1.8 MB for
Wikipedia, with the pool nearly full after the page itself.

--- a/netsurf/frontends/framebuffer/bitmap.c	2026-10-12 09:08:57.571204549 +0200
